{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二，一右手開山印，二手金剛杵，三手寶鈴，四手寶印戟，左一手都攝印，二手火輪，三手罥\n索，四手寶劍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前呪內闕九字呪句，續添入"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今添入呪句唵拶割囉醯摩尼吽吽癹"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "各念十聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "住世梵王啟請流通"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "化濁世為淨土，轉凡質作佛身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二部呪仙各還神通力"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "螺髻王於二仙處求懺悔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誦本呪靈驗畫符印，香木雕杵試驗治百病一切等事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "螺髻王得蒙授記，名曰清淨光明佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本體神王結印儀式"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本體神王化現次王忽然於虛空至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寂定如來放光本體神王放光灌化王頂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次王晝八臂相儀寶印靈符"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本體神王讚歎次王"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次二神王隱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓明無相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "繫縛歸空寂示現舍利"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "J01_p0255a11"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "J01_p0256b20"}
{"id": null, "n": "0777001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0777001", "type": "orig", "text": "此序麗本宋本元本宮本俱缺今依明本採錄"}
{"id": null, "n": "0777002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0777002", "type": "orig", "text": "此偈頌麗本宋本元本宮本俱缺今依明本採錄"}
{"id": null, "n": "0777a2901", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0777a2901", "type": "add", "text": "會【CB】【嘉興-CB】，曾【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0779b0601", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0779b0601", "type": "add", "text": "惱【CB】【嘉興-CB】，［－］【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0780b1101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0780b1101", "type": "add", "text": "肓【CB】，盲【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0781a2701", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0781a2701", "type": "add", "text": "䗫【CB】，󱓄【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0784a1501", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0784a1501", "type": "add", "text": "裹【CB】，裏【大】"}
